- [N4] Omitted trace (input 5): i1:To start the process, begin by supplying the requirement and then documenting it. -> i2:If the order is received via fax -> i3:input the order into an Excel file -> i6:Once the Excel list is complete after a week, send it to the student. -> i7:Upon receiving the Excel list, type the orders into the MS-Access database. -> i8:ensure that it is completed -> i9:Once the database is completed, control the incoming order. -> i10:At the same time, continue to do the check. -> i11:If the order is correct, release it. -> i12:Send the Excel list to the student and upon receiving it, continue with the process. -> i14:If the order is worth less than 5.000 €, release it. -> i18:Once the order is received by PPC, they will initiate production. -> i20:If the issue can be solved, release the order. -> i21:After PPC initiates production, the goods will be produced. -> i23:If not, check the quality of the goods. -> i24:Once the quality is checked, create and send a quality report to the finance department. -> i25:Release the order via memo and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse. -> i27:At the same time, commission the goods and sign and send the memo. -> i29:Finally, archive the memo and close the order. -> i30:This marks the end of the process.
- [N5] Omitted trace (input 6): i1:To start the process, begin by supplying the requirement and then documenting it. -> i2:If the order is received via fax -> i3:input the order into an Excel file -> i6:Once the Excel list is complete after a week, send it to the student. -> i7:Upon receiving the Excel list, type the orders into the MS-Access database. -> i8:ensure that it is completed -> i9:Once the database is completed, control the incoming order. -> i10:At the same time, continue to do the check. -> i11:If the order is correct, release it. -> i12:Send the Excel list to the student and upon receiving it, continue with the process. -> i14:If the order is worth less than 5.000 €, release it. -> i18:Once the order is received by PPC, they will initiate production. -> i20:If the issue can be solved, release the order. -> i21:After PPC initiates production, the goods will be produced. -> i23:If not, check the quality of the goods. -> i24:Once the quality is checked, create and send a quality report to the finance department. -> i25:Release the order via memo and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse. -> i28:Also, send the goods and ensure that the signed memo is achieved in the logistic department. -> i29:Finally, archive the memo and close the order. -> i30:This marks the end of the process.
